RECOMMENDED
  RES-101 memory_near_limit x1  The container will be ended when it reaches its limit: raise the limit or lower what it holds in memory.
  RES-102 memory_increase   x1  Look for what grows (a cache, a queue, a leak) and compare with the traffic of the same time.
  RES-201 cpu_near_limit    x1  Raise the CPU limit or add replicas; requests wait while it is at its limit.
  RES-202 cpu_increase      x2  Compare with the traffic and the deployments of the same time; look for a loop or retries.
  RES-203 cpu_throttled     x1  The limit holds the container back: raise it, or lower the work done in each request.

